  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Athletics sphere, Navigation sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When moving more than 5 feet during your turn using the movement mode corresponding to an Athletics package you possess, you may cause all squares you enter this turn to be affected by your pathing ability. This counts as the single instance of pathing which you may have active at a time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc110\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
